# Zoom recordings to ingest — paste a share link and its passcode, then let
# zoom_queue.py do the rest. Copy this to zoom_calls_input.txt (gitignored,
# because passcodes live here).
#
# One entry is a URL line followed by its Passcode line. Blank lines between
# entries are optional. Append new ones at the bottom and never prune the file:
# every link that has been handled is recorded in output/state.json, so old
# entries are skipped rather than re-processed.
#
# "#" only starts a comment at the start of a line — passcodes often contain
# #, $ and ?, and those are taken verbatim.

https://us06web.zoom.us/rec/share/<share-token>.<suffix>?startTime=<epoch-ms>
Passcode: <passcode here>
